            "answer_bg_color": "#ffffff",
            "accordion_mode": true,
            "question_1": "What is it?",
            "use_product_description_for_question_1": false,
            "answer_1": "<p>A lightweight scalp serum with cold-pressed pumpkin seed oil and 1% caffeine. Pumpkin seed oil is a clinically studied ingredient that helps support the follicle against DHT, the hormone linked to thinning. Caffeine absorbs in minutes and supports the natural growth cycle.</p><p>Non-greasy, no residue, no prescription. Made for women noticing a widening part, a thinner ponytail or more hair in the shower, and suitable for men too.</p>",
            "question_2": "How do I apply it?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Apply 1–2 ml to a dry or towel-dried scalp each night, focusing on the part and temples. Massage for 3–5 minutes, leave on overnight, don't rinse. <strong>What to expect:</strong> Weeks 1–2: less shedding · Weeks 6–8: fine new hairs at the part and temples · Day 90: visibly fuller. Apply it nightly for the full 90 days.</p>",
            "question_3": "",
            "answer_3": "",
            "question_4": "Does it really work?",
            "answer_4": "<p>Yes — pumpkin seed oil has been clinically studied for hair loss. A double-blind placebo-controlled trial found men taking pumpkin seed oil experienced significantly more hair growth than the placebo group over 24 weeks. Our formula delivers the same active compound at a therapeutic dose.</p>",
            "question_5": "What's the 90-day guarantee?",
            "answer_5": "<p>90-Day Money-Back Guarantee — no return needed. If you're not seeing fuller hair by day 90, email us for a full refund.</p>",
