            "question": "How long until I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Weeks 1–2: less shedding · Weeks 6–8: fine new hairs at the part and temples · Day 90: visibly fuller. Apply it nightly for the full 90 days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_yT7tBh": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I apply it?",
            "answer": "<p>Apply 1–2 ml to a dry scalp nightly, focusing on the part and temples. Massage in circular motions for 3–5 minutes. Leave on overnight, do not rinse.</p><p><strong>What to expect:</strong> Weeks 1–2: less shedding · Weeks 6–8: fine new hairs at the part and temples · Day 90: visibly fuller.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_zJpqH3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it work for both women and men?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. DHT-related hair loss affects both women and men and pumpkin seed oil works on the same hormonal pathway regardless of gender.</p>"
          }
        },
